  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in long-term nominal yields raises discount rates and the cost of capital, compressing valuations and making VC, PE and public fundraising for cash‑intensive AI startups less attractive, thereby reducing investment flows into AI.</data>
