<edge source="mideast_escalation::maritime_transit_risk" target="global_bond_rout::cross_border_flows" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher risk of interdiction or delays at chokepoints raises shipping costs and insurance, disrupts exports/imports and trade finance, and leads to reduced net cross-border trade and capital flows to affected corridors and counterparties.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_rout</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mideast_escalation::maritime_transit_risk" target="global_fuel_shock::diesel_import_flows" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened risk to ships transiting regional chokepoints prompts voyage cancellations, rerouting onto longer paths and higher insurance/freight costs, which leads exporters and buyers to delay or reduce diesel shipments into importing markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">global_fuel_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mideast_escalation::maritime_transit_risk" target="russia_ukraine_war::energy_supply_disruption" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising risk to shipping through chokepoints (e.g., Bab el‑Mandeb, Suez) forces route changes, convoying or delays that concretely interrupt deliveries of oil, refined products and LNG into European markets and thereby create measurable supply interruptions affecting the Russia/Ukraine energy environment.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mideast_escalation::maritime_transit_risk" target="us_china_rivalry::semiconductor_supply" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Disruptions to shipping through Red Sea/Suez or Strait of Hormuz delay arrival of critical inputs (gases, substrates, photomasks) and finished wafers, forcing fabs to slow or idle production lines.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_rivalry</data>
