  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid pace of binding AI regulations increases policy and enforcement uncertainty for technology firms and platforms, raising perceived tail-risks and causing investors to shift preferences toward safer assets (higher risk aversion).</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
