<edge source="us_china_rivalry::semiconductor_supply" target="global_bond_rout::financial_conditions" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Acute reductions or bottlenecks in advanced semiconductor supply raise input costs and margin pressure across key industries, worsening credit spreads and liquidity in affected sectors and thereby tightening aggregate financial conditions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_rout</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_rivalry::semiconductor_supply" target="global_fuel_shock::diesel_supply_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Reduced availability of advanced and legacy chips (PLCs, sensors, control units) used in refinery automation and maintenance leads to unplanned outages and lower refinery throughput, cutting diesel output.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_fuel_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_rivalry::semiconductor_supply" target="mideast_escalation::regional_security_risk" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in advanced semiconductor availability accelerates the production and fielding of precision-guided munitions, ISR systems, and armed drones by state and proxy actors in the region, increasing the intensity and probability of violent incidents.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">mideast_escalation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_rivalry::semiconductor_supply" target="russia_ukraine_war::security_threat_intensit" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher global semiconductor supply increases the availability of components for drones, EW systems, and command-and-control upgrades that can be routed (directly or via third parties) into the Russian war effort, raising the intensity and persistence of security threats on the battlefield.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
